(2772620, 386605, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, meets the challenge well. Two things that I would have changed,  first cropped out the sky / clouds in the bottom right corner of the shot and second, this isn''t so much a technical deal, more personal, I would have shot at a higher f-stop to get the detail in the sky / clouds. Still a great shot for this challenge, tones are good and composition of the main subject is spot on. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, meets the challenge well. Two things that I would have changed,  first cropped out the sky / clouds in the bottom right corner of the shot and second, this isn''t so much a technical deal, more personal, I would have shot at a higher f-stop to get the detail in the sky / clouds. Still a great shot for this challenge, tones are good and composition of the main subject is spot on. Well done.', '2006-08-30 02:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
