(2772682, 387952, 39349, '<td valign="top">Okay, you''ve got some cool stuff working for you in this shot and some things that IMHO hurt it. <br/> <br/>Stuff that''s working: Sky, great tones between the blue, pink, orange of the sunset. Like it allot. Good exposure of the moon, it doesn''t seem to be completely burned out. Great job!<br/> <br/>Stuff that''s not really working for me: There is just too much of our main subject IMHO. My eye keeps dancing around the entire frame with no central subject to focus on. Perhaps focusing on just one branch would help you our here with the composition. <br/> <br/>Overall, I do think you''ve met the challenge, good luck and keep shooting!</td>', 'Okay, you''ve got some cool stuff working for you in this shot and some things that IMHO hurt it.  Stuff that''s working: Sky, great tones between the blue, pink, orange of the sunset. Like it allot. Good exposure of the moon, it doesn''t seem to be completely burned out. Great job! Stuff that''s not really working for me: There is just too much of our main subject IMHO. My eye keeps dancing around the entire frame with no central subject to focus on. Perhaps focusing on just one branch would help you our here with the composition.  Overall, I do think you''ve met the challenge, good luck and keep shooting!', '2006-08-30 02:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2772684, 386070, 40490, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, I just don''t like the one white thing in the middle of no-where.... that''s my only complaint.</td>', 'Very nice picture, I just don''t like the one white thing in the middle of no-where.... that''s my only complaint.', '2006-08-30 02:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
