(2773352, 387808, 18073, '<td valign="top">If this don''t do well I''ll eat that hat!<br/> <br/>I love the concept of this image, the composition is nice, but can''t help but feel the the image suffers (a little) because the bottom of the boat has been cut off.  <br/> <br/>As for the lighting and mood it really is top class, the sky is great and the pose of the silhouette is great too and for me, gives the impression of someone who''s had a great time on board and perhaps had one drink too many.<br/> <br/>Good luck with this one,<br/> <br/>Darren</td>', 'If this don''t do well I''ll eat that hat! I love the concept of this image, the composition is nice, but can''t help but feel the the image suffers (a little) because the bottom of the boat has been cut off.   As for the lighting and mood it really is top class, the sky is great and the pose of the silhouette is great too and for me, gives the impression of someone who''s had a great time on board and perhaps had one drink too many. Good luck with this one, Darren', '2006-08-30 07:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
