(2773380, 387458, 18073, '<td valign="top">THis has so much potential, but I can''t help but feel you missed out.<br/> <br/>The concept, composition and technique are all great, but its the silhouette itself that lets the shot down.  The photographer is just too well hidden.  If you could have got the photographer on the ridge of the foreground for a more complete silhouette this could have really done well.<br/> <br/>As it is I think you have just missed the opportunity here, but its still a nice piece of work - 6/10</td>', 'THis has so much potential, but I can''t help but feel you missed out. The concept, composition and technique are all great, but its the silhouette itself that lets the shot down.  The photographer is just too well hidden.  If you could have got the photographer on the ridge of the foreground for a more complete silhouette this could have really done well. As it is I think you have just missed the opportunity here, but its still a nice piece of work - 6/10', '2006-08-30 07:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
