(2774098, 386243, 15711, '<td valign="top">That is really cool and unusual. I like how you have her holding up her hair.  The colors of the liquids in the glasses is a nice added touch as silhouettes are usually an orange sky, or not much color.  Nice. 8</td>', 'That is really cool and unusual. I like how you have her holding up her hair.  The colors of the liquids in the glasses is a nice added touch as silhouettes are usually an orange sky, or not much color.  Nice. 8', '2006-08-30 10:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2774106, 387462, 15711, '<td valign="top">The reds and yellows of the legs is terrific - great DOF. After viewing this, I looked up the true definition of silhouette and in fact realized this is a fitting example. I thought it had to be completely black, but an outline works just as well.  Thanks for teaching me something. 8</td>', 'The reds and yellows of the legs is terrific - great DOF. After viewing this, I looked up the true definition of silhouette and in fact realized this is a fitting example. I thought it had to be completely black, but an outline works just as well.  Thanks for teaching me something. 8', '2006-08-30 10:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2774131, 386978, 15711, '<td valign="top">He almost appears to be dancine.  Cute.  The horizon seems to be tilted to the right though, but that''s an easy fix. I wish he weren''t quite so centered.</td>', 'He almost appears to be dancine.  Cute.  The horizon seems to be tilted to the right though, but that''s an easy fix. I wish he weren''t quite so centered.', '2006-08-30 10:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2774133, 386867, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the criss cross of the window mullions. Nice idea. I think I''d crop just below the glass in her hand.</td>', 'I like the criss cross of the window mullions. Nice idea. I think I''d crop just below the glass in her hand.', '2006-08-30 10:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2774138, 387419, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. I like how the reflection of the sunset is beneath him too.</td>', 'Nicely composed. I like how the reflection of the sunset is beneath him too.', '2006-08-30 10:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2774142, 386025, 48968, '<td valign="top">I really like the copper sky, water reflection and the sun peeking between the sails. I would like to see the shoreline leveled, though - it looks the boat is sailing downhill...or maybe my head is crooked. Either way, nice shot!</td>', 'I really like the copper sky, water reflection and the sun peeking between the sails. I would like to see the shoreline leveled, though - it looks the boat is sailing downhill...or maybe my head is crooked. Either way, nice shot!', '2006-08-30 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2774145, 388012, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like that drop of light on the nose.  Interesting idea. I like it. 7</td>', 'I like that drop of light on the nose.  Interesting idea. I like it. 7', '2006-08-30 10:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
