(2774177, 388011, 15711, '<td valign="top">It''s like stardust behind the window.  IT almost has a magical quality.  Unusual and lovely. The grid of the window is interesting and makes for nice geometry. I like it.</td>', 'It''s like stardust behind the window.  IT almost has a magical quality.  Unusual and lovely. The grid of the window is interesting and makes for nice geometry. I like it.', '2006-08-30 11:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
