(2776003, 385682, 59215, '<td valign="top">smile:)<br/> <br/>My guess is that other commenters have probably mentioned the whole "I don''t think a shadow is a silhouette" or something along those lines. Which, the way it was defined in the challenge description as "Silhouettes are created by backlit subjects, which causes them to appear solid and without much, if any detail." But, by the dictionary definition, your shadow of a figure smiling is technically a silhouette... anyway, with that out of the way...<br/> <br/>It''s a nice image. It certainly conveys a mood. I only wish the lines were really sharp.</td>', 'smile:) My guess is that other commenters have probably mentioned the whole "I don''t think a shadow is a silhouette" or something along those lines. Which, the way it was defined in the challenge description as "Silhouettes are created by backlit subjects, which causes them to appear solid and without much, if any detail." But, by the dictionary definition, your shadow of a figure smiling is technically a silhouette... anyway, with that out of the way... It''s a nice image. It certainly conveys a mood. I only wish the lines were really sharp.', '2006-08-30 20:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
