(2776465, 385916, 19982, '<td valign="top">Here''s what I think about silhouettes:  If the subject needs front lighting to help you understand what it is, then it is not a strong candidate for silhouette lighting.</td>', 'Here''s what I think about silhouettes:  If the subject needs front lighting to help you understand what it is, then it is not a strong candidate for silhouette lighting.', '2006-08-30 21:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
