(2776473, 385837, 19982, '<td valign="top">Here''s what I think about silhouettes:  If the subject needs front lighting to help you understand what it is, then it is not a strong candidate for silhouette lighting.  The images that really work in this challenge have subjects in complete silhoutte against a brighter background.  It is the strength of that division, between light and dark, and the story they tell which captures the imagination.</td>', 'Here''s what I think about silhouettes:  If the subject needs front lighting to help you understand what it is, then it is not a strong candidate for silhouette lighting.  The images that really work in this challenge have subjects in complete silhoutte against a brighter background.  It is the strength of that division, between light and dark, and the story they tell which captures the imagination.', '2006-08-30 21:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776477, 387970, 60370, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting but I don''t like the towel, the tag on the towel or the black on the right.</td>', 'Nice lighting but I don''t like the towel, the tag on the towel or the black on the right.', '2006-08-30 21:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
