(2776488, 387781, 51538, '<td valign="top">The plane is a special, precision instrument with an elegant, engineering profile.  As such, your idea to use that tool was very good.  I think that the background is a little overpowering though.  I would also have been inclined to keep with warmer, perhaps golden, colours since they tend to be associated with trust, human labour, craft, guilds and etc.</td>', 'The plane is a special, precision instrument with an elegant, engineering profile.  As such, your idea to use that tool was very good.  I think that the background is a little overpowering though.  I would also have been inclined to keep with warmer, perhaps golden, colours since they tend to be associated with trust, human labour, craft, guilds and etc.', '2006-08-30 21:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
