(2776510, 387867, 19982, '<td valign="top">If you were to take this image into an editor and sample the color of the hat, you would find it is somewhere around R:69, G: 66, B: 61.  On the other hand, if you take a look at the strongest contenders in this challenge, they will probably have subjects that are much closer to R:0, G:0, B:0 (in other words, black).  The hat in this subject is too gray....</td>', 'If you were to take this image into an editor and sample the color of the hat, you would find it is somewhere around R:69, G: 66, B: 61.  On the other hand, if you take a look at the strongest contenders in this challenge, they will probably have subjects that are much closer to R:0, G:0, B:0 (in other words, black).  The hat in this subject is too gray....', '2006-08-30 21:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
