(2776552, 387728, 19982, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably been told this already but... a shadow is not the same thing as silhouette.  Silhouettes become dark because they are light from behind.  In other words, the light is in front of the camera, beyond the subject, lighting the subject from behind.  And it is typically so bright that if you adjust your exposure for the lighting in the background, the subject goes black.</td>', 'You''ve probably been told this already but... a shadow is not the same thing as silhouette.  Silhouettes become dark because they are light from behind.  In other words, the light is in front of the camera, beyond the subject, lighting the subject from behind.  And it is typically so bright that if you adjust your exposure for the lighting in the background, the subject goes black.', '2006-08-30 22:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776559, 387776, 55838, '<td valign="top">This is such an attractive and different silhouette shot.  Excellent color and gradient in the sky yet it doesn''t distract from the interesting figures. Bumping to 9.</td>', 'This is such an attractive and different silhouette shot.  Excellent color and gradient in the sky yet it doesn''t distract from the interesting figures. Bumping to 9.', '2006-08-30 22:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
