(2776597, 387728, 44575, '<td valign="top">Its a shadow, not a silhouette.  Beyond that, your shadow and your model are competing for attention.  I would have preferred a better pose for her -- perhaps looking up at the camera?  Also, I don''t think the empty space around here is working for you here.  The patchy lawn is very distracting.</td>', 'Its a shadow, not a silhouette.  Beyond that, your shadow and your model are competing for attention.  I would have preferred a better pose for her -- perhaps looking up at the camera?  Also, I don''t think the empty space around here is working for you here.  The patchy lawn is very distracting.', '2006-08-30 22:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776599, 386171, 55838, '<td valign="top">Strong emotive shot.  Excellent work.  Perfect tones in the sky to accent the very sharp silhouettes.  Beautiful job.  8</td>', 'Strong emotive shot.  Excellent work.  Perfect tones in the sky to accent the very sharp silhouettes.  Beautiful job.  8', '2006-08-30 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
