(2776615, 386736, 55838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful emotive shot.  Very strong.  Excellent composition and I even like some of the darkness to the left...but perhaps trimming a bit of it out would have been stronger.  Very nice. 8</td>', 'Beautiful emotive shot.  Very strong.  Excellent composition and I even like some of the darkness to the left...but perhaps trimming a bit of it out would have been stronger.  Very nice. 8', '2006-08-30 22:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
