(2776631, 386760, 44575, '<td valign="top">Your colors look a bit pixellated -- a result of over-processing the image, perhaps?   Beyond that the composition is good, except for the silhouette in the upper left corner.  Not sure what the red lights are in the lower right, but I think they also detract from the image. A slightly sharper focus on the horizon (the trees in particular) would also help.</td>', 'Your colors look a bit pixellated -- a result of over-processing the image, perhaps?   Beyond that the composition is good, except for the silhouette in the upper left corner.  Not sure what the red lights are in the lower right, but I think they also detract from the image. A slightly sharper focus on the horizon (the trees in particular) would also help.', '2006-08-30 22:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776632, 387331, 37252, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool backlit shot, however it really is not a silhouette.</td>', 'This is a really cool backlit shot, however it really is not a silhouette.', '2006-08-30 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2776633, 384765, 55838, '<td valign="top">So sweet.  What a great idea and special capture this is.  One of the few in the challenge that is strong even without a vibrantly colored sky.  I predict this will be one of the highest ranked straight B&amp;W shots!  (Hee hee - let''s see what a prediction from me is worth!).  Although there are those "I hate any kid shot" nazi''s out there that might hit you hard.  I''ll do my part....bumping to 9.</td>', 'So sweet.  What a great idea and special capture this is.  One of the few in the challenge that is strong even without a vibrantly colored sky.  I predict this will be one of the highest ranked straight B&W shots!  (Hee hee - let''s see what a prediction from me is worth!).  Although there are those "I hate any kid shot" nazi''s out there that might hit you hard.  I''ll do my part....bumping to 9.', '2006-08-30 22:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
