(2777219, 387617, 22543, '<td valign="top">is bedouins hacky sack?<br/> <br/>great capture of an interesting model. Several things that i am noticing are:<br/>artifacts (compression?) around the model and the trees,<br/>centered subject,<br/>strange, perhaps oversaturated colors around the bases of the palms,<br/>and vignetting (dark corners)<br/> <br/>The artifacts are strange looking and detract from the photo. You coud try resizng less, but i don''t really know what went wrong without looking at your editing steps. I don''t really think the centeredsubject works. Well, it works, but i think that it would work better a little bit to the right. the oversaturated colors may have been a result of too much post processing. The vignetting, though, works for me. it draws my eyes into the middle. Overall, wondrful combination of action and lanscape, and good luck with it. 9</td>', 'is bedouins hacky sack? great capture of an interesting model. Several things that i am noticing are:artifacts (compression?) around the model and the trees,centered subject,strange, perhaps oversaturated colors around the bases of the palms,and vignetting (dark corners) The artifacts are strange looking and detract from the photo. You coud try resizng less, but i don''t really know what went wrong without looking at your editing steps. I don''t really think the centeredsubject works. Well, it works, but i think that it would work better a little bit to the right. the oversaturated colors may have been a result of too much post processing. The vignetting, though, works for me. it draws my eyes into the middle. Overall, wondrful combination of action and lanscape, and good luck with it. 9', '2006-08-31 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2777221, 387802, 22543, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but there is too much detail in the subject, and i think the background should be lighter.</td>', 'nice shot, but there is too much detail in the subject, and i think the background should be lighter.', '2006-08-31 01:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
