(2777233, 386770, 22543, '<td valign="top">nicelydone. the jellyfish are made especially beautiful on the striking blue background. i would have cropped it more at the bottom, because there is really nothing interesting below the jelly tank. 9</td>', 'nicelydone. the jellyfish are made especially beautiful on the striking blue background. i would have cropped it more at the bottom, because there is really nothing interesting below the jelly tank. 9', '2006-08-31 01:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2777242, 387820, 22543, '<td valign="top">i like how the horizon is down at the bottom, so your eyes follow the buildings up to the beautiful sky above. i dont know if i like the position of the model. On the one hand, it is slightly annoying that you cant tell what she is doing, but on the other hand, it makes you look at the picture longer. one of my favorite things, though, are the reflections on her skirt. lastly, i would have liked to see the buildings in the horizon darker, because there is just a tiny amount of detail visible. 9</td>', 'i like how the horizon is down at the bottom, so your eyes follow the buildings up to the beautiful sky above. i dont know if i like the position of the model. On the one hand, it is slightly annoying that you cant tell what she is doing, but on the other hand, it makes you look at the picture longer. one of my favorite things, though, are the reflections on her skirt. lastly, i would have liked to see the buildings in the horizon darker, because there is just a tiny amount of detail visible. 9', '2006-08-31 01:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
