(2778357, 387650, 60779, '<td valign="top">To my eye, it''s a distracting image. There are ''lines'' going in different directions. I feel the pole hurts the picture the most. It''s not really an interesting image. 4.</td>', 'To my eye, it''s a distracting image. There are ''lines'' going in different directions. I feel the pole hurts the picture the most. It''s not really an interesting image. 4.', '2006-08-31 11:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
