(2778422, 387771, 42100, '<td valign="top">Nice colors to the sky, and that sliver of a moon looks really cool.  Composition is a bit on the static side, but overall a very nice photo.</td>', 'Nice colors to the sky, and that sliver of a moon looks really cool.  Composition is a bit on the static side, but overall a very nice photo.', '2006-08-31 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
