(2778473, 387503, 60779, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors, but there are 2 things I see that detract. To my eye, the leading line is the horizon above the trees and it seems it''s sloping too much down to the left. And, this is more of a picture with shadows than a silhouette pic. 5</td>', 'I really like the colors, but there are 2 things I see that detract. To my eye, the leading line is the horizon above the trees and it seems it''s sloping too much down to the left. And, this is more of a picture with shadows than a silhouette pic. 5', '2006-08-31 11:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778475, 386047, 60779, '<td valign="top">As the title suggests, it''s a shadow. Not an attractive or appealing image. 3</td>', 'As the title suggests, it''s a shadow. Not an attractive or appealing image. 3', '2006-08-31 11:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2778478, 385905, 60779, '<td valign="top">Everything seems as though its falling to the right. Nice silhouette and colors though. 6.</td>', 'Everything seems as though its falling to the right. Nice silhouette and colors though. 6.', '2006-08-31 11:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
