(2779943, 387127, 5885, '<td valign="top">Very nice...!</td>', 'Very nice...!', '2006-08-31 21:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2779981, 387028, 57775, '<td valign="top">LOL... very clever.  Would love to hear how you did this.</td>', 'LOL... very clever.  Would love to hear how you did this.', '2006-08-31 21:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780002, 387092, 57320, '<td valign="top">Very good! I like that this was taken at sunset, some of the mid-day ones look a little cheesy. This is simply excellent. I love how clear it is too, I see talent! (Cough Cough ribbonwinner Cough)</td>', 'Very good! I like that this was taken at sunset, some of the mid-day ones look a little cheesy. This is simply excellent. I love how clear it is too, I see talent! (Cough Cough ribbonwinner Cough)', '2006-08-31 21:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780016, 386678, 61138, '<td valign="top">The power of suggestion. Think I''ll go get me some yerba right now.</td>', 'The power of suggestion. Think I''ll go get me some yerba right now.', '2006-08-31 21:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780017, 387040, 14476, '<td valign="top">really nice lighting on this one.  10</td>', 'really nice lighting on this one.  10', '2006-08-31 21:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780038, 387084, 14476, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely solution to the Challenge.  But I wonder how it would look if you had cropped to just above the towers, including that flight of birds.  While the sky is quite nice, it doesn''t (IMO, of course) add much to the image or composition.  And you have a great story with the building and the birds.  6</td>', 'This is a lovely solution to the Challenge.  But I wonder how it would look if you had cropped to just above the towers, including that flight of birds.  While the sky is quite nice, it doesn''t (IMO, of course) add much to the image or composition.  And you have a great story with the building and the birds.  6', '2006-08-31 21:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780040, 386265, 14476, '<td valign="top">NICE abstract</td>', 'NICE abstract', '2006-08-31 21:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780045, 387266, 14476, '<td valign="top">While I would have cropped it differently (about 1/4 off the left side and some on the bottom) this takes nothing away from the difficulty and delightfulness of this image.  Nice one.  10</td>', 'While I would have cropped it differently (about 1/4 off the left side and some on the bottom) this takes nothing away from the difficulty and delightfulness of this image.  Nice one.  10', '2006-08-31 21:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780056, 387860, 14476, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge nicely.  A crop so that that good looking tree is not smack in the center, would make this image very exciting.</td>', 'Meets the challenge nicely.  A crop so that that good looking tree is not smack in the center, would make this image very exciting.', '2006-08-31 21:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
