(2780171, 385602, 44575, '<td valign="top">I really like the rock/tree combination on the left.  I think you would have made a much stronger shot by eliminating the other rocks and including the single rock with the tree and the moon.</td>', 'I really like the rock/tree combination on the left.  I think you would have made a much stronger shot by eliminating the other rocks and including the single rock with the tree and the moon.', '2006-08-31 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
