(2780236, 387975, 41047, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.</td>', 'nice lighting.', '2006-08-31 22:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780240, 387029, 41047, '<td valign="top">the colors look very pleasing. nice composition.</td>', 'the colors look very pleasing. nice composition.', '2006-08-31 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780265, 387229, 44575, '<td valign="top">Your subject is well lit, but the background needs some work -- I can see the wrinkles in the sheet.  You need to step away from it a few feet so it will be out of focus, and the imperfections in the sheet not as obvious.</td>', 'Your subject is well lit, but the background needs some work -- I can see the wrinkles in the sheet.  You need to step away from it a few feet so it will be out of focus, and the imperfections in the sheet not as obvious.', '2006-08-31 23:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780281, 385603, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think you may have cropped in too closely here.  Everything is blurry and pixellated.</td>', 'I think you may have cropped in too closely here.  Everything is blurry and pixellated.', '2006-08-31 23:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780304, 387844, 44575, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''ve got a bit of motion blur either on the bird or your camera or both.  I like both the composition and colors.  This could''ve been improved with a faster shutter speed, IMO.</td>', 'Looks like you''ve got a bit of motion blur either on the bird or your camera or both.  I like both the composition and colors.  This could''ve been improved with a faster shutter speed, IMO.', '2006-08-31 23:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780310, 387410, 44575, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Very french painting.</td>', 'Very nice.  Very french painting.', '2006-08-31 23:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780312, 386025, 40490, '<td valign="top">Wow, this picture is beautiful.  I love the location of the sun and the boat and everything.  Very clean.  The only thing is there is that little boat out in the distance. 9</td>', 'Wow, this picture is beautiful.  I love the location of the sun and the boat and everything.  Very clean.  The only thing is there is that little boat out in the distance. 9', '2006-08-31 23:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780334, 387712, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think you needed to get lower here to isolate the party-goers against the sky.  As it is they get lost in the dark foreground.</td>', 'I think you needed to get lower here to isolate the party-goers against the sky.  As it is they get lost in the dark foreground.', '2006-08-31 23:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780346, 386361, 44575, '<td valign="top">Not a silhouette?  Looks more like a pair of shadows to me.</td>', 'Not a silhouette?  Looks more like a pair of shadows to me.', '2006-08-31 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780354, 386905, 44575, '<td valign="top">You need a better focus on the spider -- I can just see hints of hairy legs, but nothing on him is sharp.  Also, a bit more contrast and focus might bring out the web better as well.   Having done that, I''d crop out some of the negative space above the spider.  Its not doing anything for the image. Most of the image should be spider and web.</td>', 'You need a better focus on the spider -- I can just see hints of hairy legs, but nothing on him is sharp.  Also, a bit more contrast and focus might bring out the web better as well.   Having done that, I''d crop out some of the negative space above the spider.  Its not doing anything for the image. Most of the image should be spider and web.', '2006-08-31 23:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780358, 385152, 60698, '<td valign="top">Looks like pain to me, but this is a very good image!</td>', 'Looks like pain to me, but this is a very good image!', '2006-08-31 23:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780366, 385682, 44575, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a shadow than a silhouette.  Also, nothing is in focus.  Composition-wise, I''d eliminate the shadows surrounding your subject as they are distracting.  I''d have the subject and the light area, but nothing else.</td>', 'This looks more like a shadow than a silhouette.  Also, nothing is in focus.  Composition-wise, I''d eliminate the shadows surrounding your subject as they are distracting.  I''d have the subject and the light area, but nothing else.', '2006-08-31 23:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780373, 384841, 44575, '<td valign="top">Your subject occupies an uncomfortable space between a silhouette and a lit figure -- it makes him look simply underexposed, more than anything else.  Also, his head and the bass get lost a bit in the window pattern behind him.</td>', 'Your subject occupies an uncomfortable space between a silhouette and a lit figure -- it makes him look simply underexposed, more than anything else.  Also, his head and the bass get lost a bit in the window pattern behind him.', '2006-08-31 23:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780375, 387247, 40490, '<td valign="top">Those clouds are horrifying...</td>', 'Those clouds are horrifying...', '2006-08-31 23:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780387, 385563, 44575, '<td valign="top">Your background is quite distracting.  Its unevenly lit and the texture of the wall is too obvious.  The figurines are a poor candidate for a silhouette because of all of the reflections from the surface.  Emotionally, this has no impact on me as I''m having trouble making any connection with the figurines.  Had these been real people, I think the passion would show much more.</td>', 'Your background is quite distracting.  Its unevenly lit and the texture of the wall is too obvious.  The figurines are a poor candidate for a silhouette because of all of the reflections from the surface.  Emotionally, this has no impact on me as I''m having trouble making any connection with the figurines.  Had these been real people, I think the passion would show much more.', '2006-08-31 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780395, 387692, 44575, '<td valign="top">Nice gloomy feel to this.  You''ve cropped it a bit too much on top, losing part of the sign, and on the right, crowding the tail of the arrow.  You''ve also lost the point of the downward-pointing arrow in the horizon.</td>', 'Nice gloomy feel to this.  You''ve cropped it a bit too much on top, losing part of the sign, and on the right, crowding the tail of the arrow.  You''ve also lost the point of the downward-pointing arrow in the horizon.', '2006-08-31 23:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780409, 386801, 44575, '<td valign="top">Your background and lighting are really hurting you here.  The background is unevenly lit and wrinkled.  To make this work, I think you''ve got to highlight the shape of the guitar, including the tuning knobs.  You''ve lost all the detail of the upper part because you''re lighting is dying out on you.  Try ironing the sheet and putting the light BEHIND it. This should make a more even light that will highlight your details better.</td>', 'Your background and lighting are really hurting you here.  The background is unevenly lit and wrinkled.  To make this work, I think you''ve got to highlight the shape of the guitar, including the tuning knobs.  You''ve lost all the detail of the upper part because you''re lighting is dying out on you.  Try ironing the sheet and putting the light BEHIND it. This should make a more even light that will highlight your details better.', '2006-08-31 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780420, 387523, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think the figurine makes a poor choice for a silhouette as it tends to reflect the light from odd angles.  Furthermore, this particular piece doesn''t have a strong outline that is necessary to make a good sihouette, IMO.</td>', 'I think the figurine makes a poor choice for a silhouette as it tends to reflect the light from odd angles.  Furthermore, this particular piece doesn''t have a strong outline that is necessary to make a good sihouette, IMO.', '2006-08-31 23:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780424, 387356, 63970, '<td valign="top">The shot would also have been well suited for the upcoming ROT II challenge.  Cool shot!</td>', 'The shot would also have been well suited for the upcoming ROT II challenge.  Cool shot!', '2006-08-31 23:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780436, 387846, 14476, '<td valign="top">comment removed</td>', 'comment removed', '2006-08-31 23:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780438, 387503, 63970, '<td valign="top">Very picturesque, lovely colors.  I would have rotated .5 to 1 degree CW to flatten out horizon.  Also, I would have loved to see a little more of the sky (might make it a little more interesting than the solid black land in the foreground.  Still, a very nice shot indeed.</td>', 'Very picturesque, lovely colors.  I would have rotated .5 to 1 degree CW to flatten out horizon.  Also, I would have loved to see a little more of the sky (might make it a little more interesting than the solid black land in the foreground.  Still, a very nice shot indeed.', '2006-08-31 23:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780440, 387417, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think your subjects look more underexposed than silhouetted.  They are in a bit of a grey zone where you''ve lost some detail, but not enough to really let the outline of the subject dominate the composition.</td>', 'I think your subjects look more underexposed than silhouetted.  They are in a bit of a grey zone where you''ve lost some detail, but not enough to really let the outline of the subject dominate the composition.', '2006-08-31 23:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780441, 387863, 63970, '<td valign="top">Lots of cool lines in this shot!</td>', 'Lots of cool lines in this shot!', '2006-08-31 23:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780444, 386416, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors. The light on the chin is a bit harsh</td>', 'Nice composition and colors. The light on the chin is a bit harsh', '2006-08-31 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780445, 386770, 63970, '<td valign="top">Cool title - fits the picture!</td>', 'Cool title - fits the picture!', '2006-08-31 23:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780448, 386327, 63970, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I can''t say a whole lot more than that.  One of my fav''s for sure!</td>', 'Wow.  I can''t say a whole lot more than that.  One of my fav''s for sure!', '2006-08-31 23:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780452, 387180, 44575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and a strong image. My only complaint is that his head gets lost in the dark region in the middle of the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful and a strong image. My only complaint is that his head gets lost in the dark region in the middle of the picture.', '2006-08-31 23:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780453, 387846, 63868, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-08-31 23:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
