(2780463, 387771, 63868, '<td valign="top">Looks like you had some motion and got multiple images of the Moon.</td>', 'Looks like you had some motion and got multiple images of the Moon.', '2006-08-31 23:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780466, 386139, 63970, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I''m diggin it.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I''m diggin it.', '2006-08-31 23:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780468, 385602, 63970, '<td valign="top">Nice look and feel to this shot.</td>', 'Nice look and feel to this shot.', '2006-08-31 23:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780470, 386032, 44575, '<td valign="top">The only thing in silhouette is part of the stair-rail.  But its not even fully sihoetted, because the half of it is in full light.  What''s more, your focus point appears to be on the landing, not the subject.  I can see how the composition relates to your title, but the silhouette doesn''t do anyting to further this theme.</td>', 'The only thing in silhouette is part of the stair-rail.  But its not even fully sihoetted, because the half of it is in full light.  What''s more, your focus point appears to be on the landing, not the subject.  I can see how the composition relates to your title, but the silhouette doesn''t do anyting to further this theme.', '2006-08-31 23:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780474, 386627, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Looks a bit over-processed (especially the interface between the land and the water)</td>', 'Nice capture. Looks a bit over-processed (especially the interface between the land and the water)', '2006-08-31 23:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780480, 385913, 63868, '<td valign="top">Great composition.</td>', 'Great composition.', '2006-08-31 23:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780486, 387871, 63868, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Nice composition.</td>', 'Great colors. Nice composition.', '2006-08-31 23:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780492, 386171, 63868, '<td valign="top">Very moving. Nice job.</td>', 'Very moving. Nice job.', '2006-08-31 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780495, 386327, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Excellent depth.</td>', 'Nice capture. Excellent depth.', '2006-08-31 23:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780500, 384445, 44575, '<td valign="top">Something about the sky is not helping you.  With so much of the picture being featureless black, it needs a little more punch.  You''ve blown out the lower part of the sky, as well.  Maybe darkening the scene as a whole or upping the contrast?  That being said, the silhouette itself is striking and growing on me the more I look at it.</td>', 'Something about the sky is not helping you.  With so much of the picture being featureless black, it needs a little more punch.  You''ve blown out the lower part of the sky, as well.  Maybe darkening the scene as a whole or upping the contrast?  That being said, the silhouette itself is striking and growing on me the more I look at it.', '2006-09-01 00:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780506, 385424, 63868, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness. Nice detail. The bright light on the other side of the ship detracts a bit.</td>', 'Great sharpness. Nice detail. The bright light on the other side of the ship detracts a bit.', '2006-09-01 00:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780509, 387854, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think this scene would be much stronger with the hooded figure and the dog, but cropping out the guy on the right. I just don''t like his pose, and his profile doesn''t really sell the "hoodlum" look to me. I like the bright background, and it fits the them very well.</td>', 'I think this scene would be much stronger with the hooded figure and the dog, but cropping out the guy on the right. I just don''t like his pose, and his profile doesn''t really sell the "hoodlum" look to me. I like the bright background, and it fits the them very well.', '2006-09-01 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780513, 386678, 44575, '<td valign="top">The sea and sun look spectacular, but your subject seems a bit out of focus -- did you end up focusing on the ocean, perhaps?</td>', 'The sea and sun look spectacular, but your subject seems a bit out of focus -- did you end up focusing on the ocean, perhaps?', '2006-09-01 00:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780516, 387462, 63868, '<td valign="top">Good focus. Good bokeh on the brightness to the right,though I think the image would be better with this because it detracts from the spider.</td>', 'Good focus. Good bokeh on the brightness to the right,though I think the image would be better with this because it detracts from the spider.', '2006-09-01 00:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780517, 387732, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got some issues with motion blur or focussing.  Composition-wise, I''d try to get a better angle to separate the bird from the tree limbs a bit better.</td>', 'I think you''ve got some issues with motion blur or focussing.  Composition-wise, I''d try to get a better angle to separate the bird from the tree limbs a bit better.', '2006-09-01 00:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780518, 386430, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice depth.</td>', 'Nice depth.', '2006-09-01 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780526, 387393, 44575, '<td valign="top">Your subject is getting lost in the background.  I think getting more of a profile him would improve the lines of the silhouette as well.</td>', 'Your subject is getting lost in the background.  I think getting more of a profile him would improve the lines of the silhouette as well.', '2006-09-01 00:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780528, 387889, 63868, '<td valign="top">Good color. Not a real big fan of the pose.</td>', 'Good color. Not a real big fan of the pose.', '2006-09-01 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780534, 387820, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice depth. Good colors.</td>', 'Nice depth. Good colors.', '2006-09-01 00:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780537, 387223, 44575, '<td valign="top">A beautiful image.  The converging lines of the pier are very striking against the dark background and floor of the pier.  Where''s the silhouette?</td>', 'A beautiful image.  The converging lines of the pier are very striking against the dark background and floor of the pier.  Where''s the silhouette?', '2006-09-01 00:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780539, 387617, 43437, '<td valign="top">i like this idea, as far as editing the colors of the sky appear very jagged and there is an oversharpened looking outline of the guy thats strange.  The colors are interesting and it does fit the challenge.</td>', 'i like this idea, as far as editing the colors of the sky appear very jagged and there is an oversharpened looking outline of the guy thats strange.  The colors are interesting and it does fit the challenge.', '2006-09-01 00:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780541, 388010, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Great composition. Nice color transition.</td>', 'Nice job. Great composition. Nice color transition.', '2006-09-01 00:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780547, 387472, 63868, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you meant to be in silhouette.</td>', 'Not sure what you meant to be in silhouette.', '2006-09-01 00:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780548, 386736, 44575, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the left is quite distracting from the image.  I''m a bit on the fence about the blinds.  The parallel lines lend something to the image, but compete with the subject.  If you keep them in, you should reposition your subjects and zoom in to eliminate the cord-tracks that hold the blinds up, leaving only the parallel lines.</td>', 'The shadow on the left is quite distracting from the image.  I''m a bit on the fence about the blinds.  The parallel lines lend something to the image, but compete with the subject.  If you keep them in, you should reposition your subjects and zoom in to eliminate the cord-tracks that hold the blinds up, leaving only the parallel lines.', '2006-09-01 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780550, 387931, 44575, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit soft.</td>', 'Focus seems a bit soft.', '2006-09-01 00:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780551, 387455, 63868, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-09-01 00:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780555, 387871, 44575, '<td valign="top">Very striking.</td>', 'Very striking.', '2006-09-01 00:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780559, 387776, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think the mesh fencing really detracts from this image.  I''d also like to see some separation between the two riders to simplify and strengthen their outlines.  As it is, the whole image is way too busy.</td>', 'I think the mesh fencing really detracts from this image.  I''d also like to see some separation between the two riders to simplify and strengthen their outlines.  As it is, the whole image is way too busy.', '2006-09-01 00:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780561, 384757, 44575, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is a silhouette....</td>', 'Not sure how this is a silhouette....', '2006-09-01 00:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780565, 387856, 43437, '<td valign="top">striking choice of color for your background.  The way this is taken its almost hard to tell which way hes looking which adds alot of interest.  Only thing i could say would make this better is to even out the darker color in the clouds, only possible in advanced i know but  i wouldnt deduct for that.  A very interesting picture and fits the challenge perfectly</td>', 'striking choice of color for your background.  The way this is taken its almost hard to tell which way hes looking which adds alot of interest.  Only thing i could say would make this better is to even out the darker color in the clouds, only possible in advanced i know but  i wouldnt deduct for that.  A very interesting picture and fits the challenge perfectly', '2006-09-01 00:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780566, 387867, 44575, '<td valign="top">A couple of issues here.  One your contrast seems a bit off as there is a "haze" over the whole image.  Your blacks aren''te truly black.  The other is that the angle of the cowboy hat combined with the frame of the window hides the hat''s strong and distinct lines.</td>', 'A couple of issues here.  One your contrast seems a bit off as there is a "haze" over the whole image.  Your blacks aren''te truly black.  The other is that the angle of the cowboy hat combined with the frame of the window hides the hat''s strong and distinct lines.', '2006-09-01 00:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780572, 387622, 44575, '<td valign="top">Strong lines, and the blown highlights really work for this picture.  The bug''s position is somewhat odd -- as if its missing limbs.</td>', 'Strong lines, and the blown highlights really work for this picture.  The bug''s position is somewhat odd -- as if its missing limbs.', '2006-09-01 00:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780579, 386617, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Good depth.</td>', 'Nice capture. Good depth.', '2006-09-01 00:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780580, 386664, 44575, '<td valign="top">A strong composition with the drowned trees receding towards the horizon.  Your lighting is your weak spot. Its really flat and grey.  Adding some contrast or darkening the image may help that.</td>', 'A strong composition with the drowned trees receding towards the horizon.  Your lighting is your weak spot. Its really flat and grey.  Adding some contrast or darkening the image may help that.', '2006-09-01 00:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780584, 387525, 44575, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh on the lights, but the dark background is hiding much of the lines of the silhouette.  Hiding the table would help preserve the illusion that this is anything other than a model.</td>', 'Nice bokeh on the lights, but the dark background is hiding much of the lines of the silhouette.  Hiding the table would help preserve the illusion that this is anything other than a model.', '2006-09-01 00:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780590, 387883, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got too much silhouette in this -- its too dark and the overlapping lines are quite busy.</td>', 'I think you''ve got too much silhouette in this -- its too dark and the overlapping lines are quite busy.', '2006-09-01 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780594, 384477, 44575, '<td valign="top">The focus is a shade soft.  A tighter crop on the subject would reduce the distraction of that big shadow on the right.</td>', 'The focus is a shade soft.  A tighter crop on the subject would reduce the distraction of that big shadow on the right.', '2006-09-01 00:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780595, 385392, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.</td>', 'Nice focus.', '2006-09-01 00:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780599, 384843, 64928, '<td valign="top">Sorry to give a low rating, but the silhouette of the thinker blended so much into the background he is hard to distinguish.</td>', 'Sorry to give a low rating, but the silhouette of the thinker blended so much into the background he is hard to distinguish.', '2006-09-01 00:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780602, 385949, 63868, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture.</td>', 'Interesting capture.', '2006-09-01 00:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780605, 384492, 63868, '<td valign="top">Nice. Wish I was there.</td>', 'Nice. Wish I was there.', '2006-09-01 00:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780606, 385933, 44575, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop on the girl would dramatically increase the strength of the composition.  The girl has the emotion that drives this photo -- the boy on the right is a distraction.</td>', 'I think a tighter crop on the girl would dramatically increase the strength of the composition.  The girl has the emotion that drives this photo -- the boy on the right is a distraction.', '2006-09-01 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2780608, 387792, 63868, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit off.</td>', 'Focus is a bit off.', '2006-09-01 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
