(2781304, 388008, 59697, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and excellent color. I would prefer to only have the palms and not the bush/tree top on the bottom of the image, it makes it a little cluttered. Also I would have cropped a little more of the bottom so you don''t see the power lines, or clone them out. Otherwise, nice work!</td>', 'Very nice composition and excellent color. I would prefer to only have the palms and not the bush/tree top on the bottom of the image, it makes it a little cluttered. Also I would have cropped a little more of the bottom so you don''t see the power lines, or clone them out. Otherwise, nice work!', '2006-09-01 02:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2781420, 387651, 48541, '<td valign="top">this is a really good one.  though cargo shorts and short sleeves don''t scream religion.  still, really nice.</td>', 'this is a really good one.  though cargo shorts and short sleeves don''t scream religion.  still, really nice.', '2006-09-01 02:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
