(2782286, 387688, 51653, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I cannot find an interesting point in this shot.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I cannot find an interesting point in this shot.', '2006-09-01 08:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782287, 387893, 51653, '<td valign="top">I find the bird are too little to be interesting.</td>', 'I find the bird are too little to be interesting.', '2006-09-01 08:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782290, 386651, 51653, '<td valign="top">This could be an interesting shot, but I think you should iron the sheet before trying this kind of pics. I think the creases really damage the whole shot.</td>', 'This could be an interesting shot, but I think you should iron the sheet before trying this kind of pics. I think the creases really damage the whole shot.', '2006-09-01 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782291, 387260, 51653, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid, I find it too blur</td>', 'I''m afraid, I find it too blur', '2006-09-01 08:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782293, 387970, 51653, '<td valign="top">I nice idea, but there are two things I do not like of this shot. <br/>I think you could take more care of the background, because the towel lines and especially the sheet creases can really jeopardize the elegance of the best shot.<br/>I do not like seeing so much details on the body (but I like to see them on the face).</td>', 'I nice idea, but there are two things I do not like of this shot. I think you could take more care of the background, because the towel lines and especially the sheet creases can really jeopardize the elegance of the best shot.I do not like seeing so much details on the body (but I like to see them on the face).', '2006-09-01 08:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782295, 387883, 51653, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, but I find it a bit too chaotic and I cannot understand were is the subject.</td>', 'I like the colors, but I find it a bit too chaotic and I cannot understand were is the subject.', '2006-09-01 08:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782303, 385916, 51653, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure it exactly meets the challenge because the border line is not very interesting and quite all the shot interest is given by the few beard details.<br/>In other words, it is surely a silhouette sjot, but all the interest is due to something should not be visible in a "true" silhouette.</td>', 'I''m not sure it exactly meets the challenge because the border line is not very interesting and quite all the shot interest is given by the few beard details.In other words, it is surely a silhouette sjot, but all the interest is due to something should not be visible in a "true" silhouette.', '2006-09-01 08:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782308, 387782, 51653, '<td valign="top">Which is the subject? My eyes is attracted by the kite, so it seems to be the subject, while the siluate is a secondary element not very attractive.</td>', 'Which is the subject? My eyes is attracted by the kite, so it seems to be the subject, while the siluate is a secondary element not very attractive.', '2006-09-01 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782309, 387057, 51653, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit too soft</td>', 'It seems a bit too soft', '2006-09-01 08:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782498, 385155, 51653, '<td valign="top">Not only silhouettes! Even reflected silhouette! It really meets the challenge!<br/>A really amazing shot.</td>', 'Not only silhouettes! Even reflected silhouette! It really meets the challenge!A really amazing shot.', '2006-09-01 09:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782499, 387715, 51653, '<td valign="top">Great shot. One of my favorites in the challenge. The contrast between the black silhouette and the golden liquid makes it a really attractive one.</td>', 'Great shot. One of my favorites in the challenge. The contrast between the black silhouette and the golden liquid makes it a really attractive one.', '2006-09-01 09:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782500, 387735, 51653, '<td valign="top">One of the best I voted up to now.</td>', 'One of the best I voted up to now.', '2006-09-01 09:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782522, 387156, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very pretty the way the light shines through the umbrella.  I like the lacy silhoutte contrasted with the dark shoreline and the bright sunset.</td>', 'Very pretty the way the light shines through the umbrella.  I like the lacy silhoutte contrasted with the dark shoreline and the bright sunset.', '2006-09-01 09:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782525, 386400, 64928, '<td valign="top">The reflections add interest to this photo</td>', 'The reflections add interest to this photo', '2006-09-01 09:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782540, 387732, 27524, '<td valign="top">Image feels taken from distance and with little light that causes bad focus. Composition is way too complicated and distracting from main subject. Suggesting to find better angle of capture. Keep shooting!</td>', 'Image feels taken from distance and with little light that causes bad focus. Composition is way too complicated and distracting from main subject. Suggesting to find better angle of capture. Keep shooting!', '2006-09-01 09:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782545, 387617, 27524, '<td valign="top">Subject and composition is interesting but focus and quality of capture seems pretty poor. Suggesting to use tripoid if you have for night shoting.</td>', 'Subject and composition is interesting but focus and quality of capture seems pretty poor. Suggesting to use tripoid if you have for night shoting.', '2006-09-01 09:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782551, 387875, 27524, '<td valign="top">Might be as good personal shoot of your child but focus seems more on the sky then child. Also contrast feels bit too harsh.</td>', 'Might be as good personal shoot of your child but focus seems more on the sky then child. Also contrast feels bit too harsh.', '2006-09-01 09:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782563, 387808, 61138, '<td valign="top">I love the playfulness of this image. The boat''s pretty impressive, too!</td>', 'I love the playfulness of this image. The boat''s pretty impressive, too!', '2006-09-01 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2782566, 385603, 27524, '<td valign="top">That would be photograpy without subject. Nothing particulary catches your attention. Moust interesting part of it is slice of sky but its pretty tight cropped. I would like to see it bit more from distance.</td>', 'That would be photograpy without subject. Nothing particulary catches your attention. Moust interesting part of it is slice of sky but its pretty tight cropped. I would like to see it bit more from distance.', '2006-09-01 09:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782573, 385668, 27524, '<td valign="top">I like the things I see but quality takes it seriously down. Also would like to see more of sky...for my taste too tight cropped.</td>', 'I like the things I see but quality takes it seriously down. Also would like to see more of sky...for my taste too tight cropped.', '2006-09-01 09:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782579, 386226, 61138, '<td valign="top">This really makes an impact. The scene feels huge. The span of the wires, the vista of sky. I like the way you''ve framed it so the ground is almost out of frame...it emphasizes the tower and sky to maximum effect. Colours are lovely...even to my colour-blind eyes.</td>', 'This really makes an impact. The scene feels huge. The span of the wires, the vista of sky. I like the way you''ve framed it so the ground is almost out of frame...it emphasizes the tower and sky to maximum effect. Colours are lovely...even to my colour-blind eyes.', '2006-09-01 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782581, 387655, 27524, '<td valign="top">Almoust abstract photo. It doesnt catches my interest for long. The wall is not much interesting and your main subject seems too complecated. Just my opinion.</td>', 'Almoust abstract photo. It doesnt catches my interest for long. The wall is not much interesting and your main subject seems too complecated. Just my opinion.', '2006-09-01 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782582, 387994, 61138, '<td valign="top">Elegant simplicity. I give it a 9.</td>', 'Elegant simplicity. I give it a 9.', '2006-09-01 10:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782585, 384303, 27524, '<td valign="top">The subject might be interesting but it doesnt look particulary romantic. Some dark corner with lamp covered with cloth. Also seem there was focus problems. Maybe as romantic light could try some candle light. Keep shoting!</td>', 'The subject might be interesting but it doesnt look particulary romantic. Some dark corner with lamp covered with cloth. Also seem there was focus problems. Maybe as romantic light could try some candle light. Keep shoting!', '2006-09-01 10:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782588, 387808, 64928, '<td valign="top">Very interesting positioning of subject and lighting.</td>', 'Very interesting positioning of subject and lighting.', '2006-09-01 10:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2782591, 386517, 27524, '<td valign="top">Nice sky but main object clearly doens have focus. Composition feels too centered and lacks some interest.</td>', 'Nice sky but main object clearly doens have focus. Composition feels too centered and lacks some interest.', '2006-09-01 10:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
