(2786669, 387612, 48541, '<td valign="top">i''m not totally feeling the background color but it does fit the safari theme.  this photo is so much fun.  most impressive composition.  was it hard to do?  this one was in the top of the challenge. excellent.</td>', 'i''m not totally feeling the background color but it does fit the safari theme.  this photo is so much fun.  most impressive composition.  was it hard to do?  this one was in the top of the challenge. excellent.', '2006-09-02 02:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2786672, 386902, 48541, '<td valign="top">the look of the sunsetting is cool.  really feels like he trains hard to play.  good DOF and love that its an action shot.  great one.</td>', 'the look of the sunsetting is cool.  really feels like he trains hard to play.  good DOF and love that its an action shot.  great one.', '2006-09-02 02:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
