(2788958, 387094, 44575, '<td valign="top">I''m going to be honest -- the subject matter doesn''t do anything for me.  I''m guessing its some type of toy eating an Oreo cookie?  That being said, it looks in focus, the lighting is appropriate for the shot (though some might not like the fall off in the corners).  Even the cookie crumbs work well for the composition, IMHO.  Might be improved with just a touch of light on the cookie to make it more recognizable.</td>', 'I''m going to be honest -- the subject matter doesn''t do anything for me.  I''m guessing its some type of toy eating an Oreo cookie?  That being said, it looks in focus, the lighting is appropriate for the shot (though some might not like the fall off in the corners).  Even the cookie crumbs work well for the composition, IMHO.  Might be improved with just a touch of light on the cookie to make it more recognizable.', '2006-09-02 16:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2788980, 385168, 20236, '<td valign="top">Great pose and nice background.</td>', 'Great pose and nice background.', '2006-09-02 16:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789027, 385457, 44575, '<td valign="top">Like the set up, although the glow from the fire seems to be bleeding around your figure on the right side a bit giving them a 2-D look (or spoiling an illusion of a 3D figure).</td>', 'Like the set up, although the glow from the fire seems to be bleeding around your figure on the right side a bit giving them a 2-D look (or spoiling an illusion of a 3D figure).', '2006-09-02 16:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789073, 385367, 44575, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset with striking colors.  The pole is aligned with the rule of thirds, though the flag is a bit above it.  The composition might be stronger with a bit more space above the flag.  I also would have like to have seen more of the flag -- if you could have caught this with more of a breeze (maybe difficult if this required a slow shutter speed).</td>', 'Beautiful sunset with striking colors.  The pole is aligned with the rule of thirds, though the flag is a bit above it.  The composition might be stronger with a bit more space above the flag.  I also would have like to have seen more of the flag -- if you could have caught this with more of a breeze (maybe difficult if this required a slow shutter speed).', '2006-09-02 17:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789087, 387147, 44575, '<td valign="top">The subject matter has the potential for a dramatic picture.  The uneven lighting of your background is hurting you becuase your subject falls into one of the shadowed regions and is lost.</td>', 'The subject matter has the potential for a dramatic picture.  The uneven lighting of your background is hurting you becuase your subject falls into one of the shadowed regions and is lost.', '2006-09-02 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789152, 387612, 60477, '<td valign="top">Cirque du Excellent...10 plus</td>', 'Cirque du Excellent...10 plus', '2006-09-02 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789200, 387260, 44575, '<td valign="top">Nothing appears to be sharp in this picture.  The composition doesn''t really draw me in.  Your figure is centered, so maybe trying to align him/her more according to the rule of thirds would help.  For instance, I don''t think the window on the right is adding anything to the picture.  A tighter crop on that side (combined with a better focus) might improve things a bit.</td>', 'Nothing appears to be sharp in this picture.  The composition doesn''t really draw me in.  Your figure is centered, so maybe trying to align him/her more according to the rule of thirds would help.  For instance, I don''t think the window on the right is adding anything to the picture.  A tighter crop on that side (combined with a better focus) might improve things a bit.', '2006-09-02 17:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789221, 387419, 61863, '<td valign="top">Great sky......and water reflection</td>', 'Great sky......and water reflection', '2006-09-02 17:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789223, 385868, 44575, '<td valign="top">I like the scene in general.  I wish you''d chosen the more distant stumps/trees as your subject rather than the close tree in the upper left.  I find the stumps rising out of the lake a far more interesting subject.  Focusing on the stumps or using a larger DOF to put those in focus as well as the near tree would really improve this picture.</td>', 'I like the scene in general.  I wish you''d chosen the more distant stumps/trees as your subject rather than the close tree in the upper left.  I find the stumps rising out of the lake a far more interesting subject.  Focusing on the stumps or using a larger DOF to put those in focus as well as the near tree would really improve this picture.', '2006-09-02 17:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789236, 387994, 57886, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tones in your picture. Long exposures are my favorite, like the outcome of the light in the lighthouse (I assume)....</td>', 'Love the blue tones in your picture. Long exposures are my favorite, like the outcome of the light in the lighthouse (I assume)....', '2006-09-02 17:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789241, 386047, 44575, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of potential in this shot, but the model''s position is awkward.  She isn''t positioned so that any part of her silhouette is properly focused against the sheet.  The hands touching the sheet could have provided the point of interest, but they seem a bit off as well.  The one hand is curved into a "claw", yet nothing else in the model''s position really sells the emotional state that would lead to the hand position (ectasy, pain, fear, anger, etc.)</td>', 'There is a lot of potential in this shot, but the model''s position is awkward.  She isn''t positioned so that any part of her silhouette is properly focused against the sheet.  The hands touching the sheet could have provided the point of interest, but they seem a bit off as well.  The one hand is curved into a "claw", yet nothing else in the model''s position really sells the emotional state that would lead to the hand position (ectasy, pain, fear, anger, etc.)', '2006-09-02 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789252, 388031, 44575, '<td valign="top">I like the background color and the subject, I just wish you could have gotten more separation between the fly and whatever its sitting on -- it would have been nice to see the legs and lower body.  The curve of the support surface on the left is distracting from the overall image, IMO.</td>', 'I like the background color and the subject, I just wish you could have gotten more separation between the fly and whatever its sitting on -- it would have been nice to see the legs and lower body.  The curve of the support surface on the left is distracting from the overall image, IMO.', '2006-09-02 17:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789260, 384203, 44575, '<td valign="top">Two things are working against you here.  A cluttered background with dark regions obscures your subject and competes for the viewers eye.  Also, the pose of your model hides the stronger outlines of her face, making for a less distinct shape and much less impact as an image.</td>', 'Two things are working against you here.  A cluttered background with dark regions obscures your subject and competes for the viewers eye.  Also, the pose of your model hides the stronger outlines of her face, making for a less distinct shape and much less impact as an image.', '2006-09-02 17:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789261, 387613, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, beautiful sunset, nice pose - you can see the outlines of the climber... well done :o)</td>', 'Nice picture, beautiful sunset, nice pose - you can see the outlines of the climber... well done :o)', '2006-09-02 17:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789267, 386307, 57886, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.. Like the color of her "dress", the crop of the picture, her smiling face and the silhouette of her face...</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.. Like the color of her "dress", the crop of the picture, her smiling face and the silhouette of her face...', '2006-09-02 17:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789272, 385152, 44575, '<td valign="top">Great out-of-the-box choice of subject matter.  I don''t like that the person is not as in focus as the thorns.  Your crop is way too wide as well.  A single hand griping (or appearing to grip -- ouch!) the thorns would make for a much stronger image.</td>', 'Great out-of-the-box choice of subject matter.  I don''t like that the person is not as in focus as the thorns.  Your crop is way too wide as well.  A single hand griping (or appearing to grip -- ouch!) the thorns would make for a much stronger image.', '2006-09-02 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789276, 387763, 57886, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and a nice capture of the moon... The tree looks a little sad :o( Nicely done...</td>', 'Beautiful colors and a nice capture of the moon... The tree looks a little sad :o( Nicely done...', '2006-09-02 17:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789288, 386054, 44575, '<td valign="top">I like the subject matter, although that looks like more than a "breeze" blowing your model''s hair.  I''m not happy with the post processing -- you appear to have pushed saturation or contrast pretty high, resulting in odd colors at the edge of the silhouette.  Also, the image is a bit soft, it could have benefitted from a faster shutter speed, perhaps.</td>', 'I like the subject matter, although that looks like more than a "breeze" blowing your model''s hair.  I''m not happy with the post processing -- you appear to have pushed saturation or contrast pretty high, resulting in odd colors at the edge of the silhouette.  Also, the image is a bit soft, it could have benefitted from a faster shutter speed, perhaps.', '2006-09-02 17:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789297, 385868, 57886, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors... The reflexion is nice also... hm, the tree doesn´t look that interesting to me as the subject of a picture but, overall it is nice   - 7</td>', 'Stunning colors... The reflexion is nice also... hm, the tree doesn´t look that interesting to me as the subject of a picture but, overall it is nice   - 7', '2006-09-02 17:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789302, 387477, 44575, '<td valign="top">Very simple and clean choice of subject.  The curves of the horns provide strong lines that allow a little light to define your shape.  I''d have cropped a bit off the bottom and maybe let a bit more on the top to draw the eye to the interesting part of the subject a bit more easily.</td>', 'Very simple and clean choice of subject.  The curves of the horns provide strong lines that allow a little light to define your shape.  I''d have cropped a bit off the bottom and maybe let a bit more on the top to draw the eye to the interesting part of the subject a bit more easily.', '2006-09-02 17:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789311, 385680, 44575, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and colors.  The subject matter is very iconic for a summer sunset scene.  The subject isn''t in good focus, though, marring an otherwise superb picture.</td>', 'Love the composition and colors.  The subject matter is very iconic for a summer sunset scene.  The subject isn''t in good focus, though, marring an otherwise superb picture.', '2006-09-02 17:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789319, 386435, 57886, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the silhouette of the woman :o) The colors of the picture I don´t like as much... But that is just MHO....  The subject is nice and overall the picture is good... Good luck..</td>', 'I like the pose and the silhouette of the woman :o) The colors of the picture I don´t like as much... But that is just MHO....  The subject is nice and overall the picture is good... Good luck..', '2006-09-02 17:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789330, 387393, 37961, '<td valign="top">Freaking Fabulous Sherpet!!! OH man. 10.</td>', 'Freaking Fabulous Sherpet!!! OH man. 10.', '2006-09-02 17:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789337, 386434, 57886, '<td valign="top">Love the colors... IMHO the picture would have looked nicer if the windmills were pictured from a more interesting point of wiew...??? but, I do like this picture...  Good luck :o)</td>', 'Love the colors... IMHO the picture would have looked nicer if the windmills were pictured from a more interesting point of wiew...??? but, I do like this picture...  Good luck :o)', '2006-09-02 17:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789341, 385905, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette, like the details of the leaves and all the flowers..</td>', 'Nice silhouette, like the details of the leaves and all the flowers..', '2006-09-02 17:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789352, 384708, 57886, '<td valign="top">This picture would have been perfect IMHO if the .... left side would stand out from the background like the right side (ap. back vs. front)...  Love the colors and the angle you took the picture... Well captured - good luck (8)</td>', 'This picture would have been perfect IMHO if the .... left side would stand out from the background like the right side (ap. back vs. front)...  Love the colors and the angle you took the picture... Well captured - good luck (8)', '2006-09-02 17:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789355, 387893, 44575, '<td valign="top">The birds silhouettes are very striking.  My only complaint is you''ve got a lot of empty space without birds, especially in the lower half of the image.  This might be stronger if you had cropped it down to the upper right quarter of the image.<br/> <br/>[Edit]  I take that back.  After looking at some of the other bird shots, the empty space is what really sets the picture apart -- the smallness of the birds against the vastness of the sky.  I get it now.  Excellent!  Bumping up.</td>', 'The birds silhouettes are very striking.  My only complaint is you''ve got a lot of empty space without birds, especially in the lower half of the image.  This might be stronger if you had cropped it down to the upper right quarter of the image. [Edit]  I take that back.  After looking at some of the other bird shots, the empty space is what really sets the picture apart -- the smallness of the birds against the vastness of the sky.  I get it now.  Excellent!  Bumping up.', '2006-09-02 17:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789366, 386801, 57886, '<td valign="top">Hm, guitars look nice when pictured with a good light - but, IMHO the shape is to simple to look that nice as a silhouette???</td>', 'Hm, guitars look nice when pictured with a good light - but, IMHO the shape is to simple to look that nice as a silhouette???', '2006-09-02 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789368, 386978, 44575, '<td valign="top">A nice shot that captures the harsh brightness of the day.  I wish you''d caught a bit less sun and more of the backlit water.</td>', 'A nice shot that captures the harsh brightness of the day.  I wish you''d caught a bit less sun and more of the backlit water.', '2006-09-02 17:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789374, 387927, 44575, '<td valign="top">Would have been much better if your subject had been in the lighter area to the right of the image, rather than the darker left side.</td>', 'Would have been much better if your subject had been in the lighter area to the right of the image, rather than the darker left side.', '2006-09-02 17:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789399, 387900, 44575, '<td valign="top">A bit less dark on the top of the photo would have made a better silhouette of the kite. I like the composition and the subject.  A blue sky would have been better emotion-wise for the shot.</td>', 'A bit less dark on the top of the photo would have made a better silhouette of the kite. I like the composition and the subject.  A blue sky would have been better emotion-wise for the shot.', '2006-09-02 17:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789415, 387781, 44575, '<td valign="top">Not really thrilled with the post-processing here.  You appear to have pushed the saturation too far for my tastes.  Compositionally, the buildings in the back are really competing with your subject.  It might have been better to pick an angle where they are framing rather than directly behind the sculpture.</td>', 'Not really thrilled with the post-processing here.  You appear to have pushed the saturation too far for my tastes.  Compositionally, the buildings in the back are really competing with your subject.  It might have been better to pick an angle where they are framing rather than directly behind the sculpture.', '2006-09-02 18:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789431, 386430, 44575, '<td valign="top">Normally I would complain that the background shadows are obscuring the lines of your subject, but here the background appears to be PART of the subject.  The whole image makes me think of those intensely bright days where you have to squint to see.  I think you''ve done an excellent job capturing this.</td>', 'Normally I would complain that the background shadows are obscuring the lines of your subject, but here the background appears to be PART of the subject.  The whole image makes me think of those intensely bright days where you have to squint to see.  I think you''ve done an excellent job capturing this.', '2006-09-02 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789432, 388012, 44575, '<td valign="top">Very ominous.  At first glance it seems overly dark, but the more I look at it more more I like it.  I might suggest a different title such as "Trapped", though.</td>', 'Very ominous.  At first glance it seems overly dark, but the more I look at it more more I like it.  I might suggest a different title such as "Trapped", though.', '2006-09-02 18:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789466, 387845, 52449, '<td valign="top">Great colors. I just wish that the horse was more to the right of center.</td>', 'Great colors. I just wish that the horse was more to the right of center.', '2006-09-02 18:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789476, 387092, 52449, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. However, a little cropping so that the flower wasn''t in the center (maybe a bit to the left) would have raised my vote.</td>', 'I love the colors. However, a little cropping so that the flower wasn''t in the center (maybe a bit to the left) would have raised my vote.', '2006-09-02 18:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789595, 387746, 57886, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, I like the sky and the mans silhouette... the red spot in the bottle is a great addition to a good picture..</td>', 'Nice framing, I like the sky and the mans silhouette... the red spot in the bottle is a great addition to a good picture..', '2006-09-02 18:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789602, 386228, 57886, '<td valign="top">Sweet subject... The only distracting thing for me is that the grass hides the mans feet... other from that I like this picture a lot (could make the blue more outstanding IMHO) but... good luck :o)</td>', 'Sweet subject... The only distracting thing for me is that the grass hides the mans feet... other from that I like this picture a lot (could make the blue more outstanding IMHO) but... good luck :o)', '2006-09-02 18:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789605, 387860, 27339, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t retouch those dust spots...</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t retouch those dust spots...', '2006-09-02 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789609, 386736, 57886, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect picture... Love everything about it.. I think it is nice to see a littlebit of the boys sholder, it adds to the beauty of the picture.. also the dark left side off it... BEAUTIFUL</td>', 'Absolutely perfect picture... Love everything about it.. I think it is nice to see a littlebit of the boys sholder, it adds to the beauty of the picture.. also the dark left side off it... BEAUTIFUL', '2006-09-02 18:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789618, 387462, 57886, '<td valign="top">Hate spiders, love this picture... a very good capture of this distracting creature.. nice colors and DOF, beautiful how you captured the detail of the veb.. well done :o)</td>', 'Hate spiders, love this picture... a very good capture of this distracting creature.. nice colors and DOF, beautiful how you captured the detail of the veb.. well done :o)', '2006-09-02 18:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789620, 387975, 57886, '<td valign="top">The thing I most like about this picture is the color and the lightning in the bowl... stunning.</td>', 'The thing I most like about this picture is the color and the lightning in the bowl... stunning.', '2006-09-02 18:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789622, 385913, 27339, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, it is very balanced.</td>', 'Nice composition, it is very balanced.', '2006-09-02 18:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789678, 387371, 57886, '<td valign="top">The feeling of this picture is so nice... kind of lonely and pieceful... Love the colors.. The man walking into the picture and the structure above, absolutely does this picture for me... well done :o)</td>', 'The feeling of this picture is so nice... kind of lonely and pieceful... Love the colors.. The man walking into the picture and the structure above, absolutely does this picture for me... well done :o)', '2006-09-02 19:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789684, 387953, 57886, '<td valign="top">Very well done.. love the sky and the see :o)</td>', 'Very well done.. love the sky and the see :o)', '2006-09-02 19:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789693, 385155, 57886, '<td valign="top">Stunning in every way :o)</td>', 'Stunning in every way :o)', '2006-09-02 19:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789835, 386366, 18073, '<td valign="top">A nice attempt, but for me the image is very flat.  You have a nice, interesting silhouette, but I think you could do with underexposing the shot by another stop or so to get the silhouette darker, and that might hopefully bring out a little more colour in the sky.</td>', 'A nice attempt, but for me the image is very flat.  You have a nice, interesting silhouette, but I think you could do with underexposing the shot by another stop or so to get the silhouette darker, and that might hopefully bring out a little more colour in the sky.', '2006-09-02 20:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789842, 385680, 18073, '<td valign="top">Shame about the stick growing out of the top of the girls head.  The rest of the image is really nice though.  I like the highly saturated colour, the detail in the foreground and on the little island in the distance is nice too.  For your own use, clone out that stick and you will have a very nice image indeed.  Goode effort and good luck.</td>', 'Shame about the stick growing out of the top of the girls head.  The rest of the image is really nice though.  I like the highly saturated colour, the detail in the foreground and on the little island in the distance is nice too.  For your own use, clone out that stick and you will have a very nice image indeed.  Goode effort and good luck.', '2006-09-02 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789850, 387232, 18073, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a great sky.  The silhouette itself is a little boring if I am honest.  Its a shame you couldn''t find something more interesting to silhouette against this fabulous sky, perhaps a person on the hill in the distance there instead of this messy bush.  A missed opportunity for me I am afraid.</td>', 'Wow, what a great sky.  The silhouette itself is a little boring if I am honest.  Its a shame you couldn''t find something more interesting to silhouette against this fabulous sky, perhaps a person on the hill in the distance there instead of this messy bush.  A missed opportunity for me I am afraid.', '2006-09-02 20:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789856, 386785, 18073, '<td valign="top">Loveley, calming image.  Nice clarity on the dandilion clock and the bokeh is great too, showing just enough detail of the sunset.  I also like the colour here, very nice!  Good job!</td>', 'Loveley, calming image.  Nice clarity on the dandilion clock and the bokeh is great too, showing just enough detail of the sunset.  I also like the colour here, very nice!  Good job!', '2006-09-02 20:21:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2789865, 387462, 18073, '<td valign="top">I am afraid the spider doesn''t really stand out from the background enough for me.  The rim lighting on the underside of the spider is nice though.  Perhaps you could of altered your position to shoot the spider against a lighter background instead of the black on black you have here.</td>', 'I am afraid the spider doesn''t really stand out from the background enough for me.  The rim lighting on the underside of the spider is nice though.  Perhaps you could of altered your position to shoot the spider against a lighter background instead of the black on black you have here.', '2006-09-02 20:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789873, 388008, 18073, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sky here, with lovely detail and vibrant colours.  The Palms are also very nice and have lots of nice detail, for me though, the bush beneath the palms is very messy and distracting, which is a shame as the shot has so much potential. 5/10</td>', 'Wonderful sky here, with lovely detail and vibrant colours.  The Palms are also very nice and have lots of nice detail, for me though, the bush beneath the palms is very messy and distracting, which is a shame as the shot has so much potential. 5/10', '2006-09-02 20:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789889, 384492, 18073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Lovely cool colours instead of the hot reds and oranges elswhere in this challenge make your image stand out from the croud here.<br/> <br/>I think that there could be just a little more foregound here though, as the thin black strip across the bottom doesn''t feel right too me (but this is just my opinion of course).<br/> <br/>The palms are very nice and clean and I like them a lot.  Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Lovely cool colours instead of the hot reds and oranges elswhere in this challenge make your image stand out from the croud here. I think that there could be just a little more foregound here though, as the thin black strip across the bottom doesn''t feel right too me (but this is just my opinion of course). The palms are very nice and clean and I like them a lot.  Nice work.', '2006-09-02 20:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789895, 387331, 18073, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph here, really.<br/> <br/>But I can''t decide if it qualifies as a silhouette.  I seems more like its side lit to me with that wonderfull rim lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful photograph here, really. But I can''t decide if it qualifies as a silhouette.  I seems more like its side lit to me with that wonderfull rim lighting.', '2006-09-02 20:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789898, 387650, 18073, '<td valign="top">It is indeed a nice sky, but I am afraid the silhouettes are a little dull and uninspiring.</td>', 'It is indeed a nice sky, but I am afraid the silhouettes are a little dull and uninspiring.', '2006-09-02 20:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789907, 386099, 18073, '<td valign="top">Fab image!  I love the colours and the silhouette is great.  The pose of the model is particularly nice, and seems almost ''triumphant'', as if she/he has just scaled the rock she is standing on.  <br/> <br/>I think what would make this a 10 out of 10 for me would be if the rock face went all the way down off the edge of the image, instead of disappearing into the horizon.  As it is though, this is still a fabulouse image and I am sure it will do well.  8/10</td>', 'Fab image!  I love the colours and the silhouette is great.  The pose of the model is particularly nice, and seems almost ''triumphant'', as if she/he has just scaled the rock she is standing on.   I think what would make this a 10 out of 10 for me would be if the rock face went all the way down off the edge of the image, instead of disappearing into the horizon.  As it is though, this is still a fabulouse image and I am sure it will do well.  8/10', '2006-09-02 20:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789916, 387419, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  The silhouette is nice and I really like the detail in the snorkel.  Composition is nice as is the colour.  <br/> <br/>I can''t work out what the swimmer is holding, but it unfortunately makes the guy look like he has 1 leg bigger than the other, still this is nitpicking really).<br/> <br/>Its a nice image, with a nice feel and lots of detail.  I enjoyed looking at it so thank you.</td>', 'Nice image.  The silhouette is nice and I really like the detail in the snorkel.  Composition is nice as is the colour.   I can''t work out what the swimmer is holding, but it unfortunately makes the guy look like he has 1 leg bigger than the other, still this is nitpicking really). Its a nice image, with a nice feel and lots of detail.  I enjoyed looking at it so thank you.', '2006-09-02 20:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789920, 387871, 18073, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, simply gorgeous.  The colur, composition and subject are all superb here.  <br/> <br/>If I were to nitpick, its a shame the model isnt higher up on the horizon, but that is being very picky.  This is a top drawer image and will make the top 10 or I''ll eat my hat!</td>', 'Gorgeous, simply gorgeous.  The colur, composition and subject are all superb here.   If I were to nitpick, its a shame the model isnt higher up on the horizon, but that is being very picky.  This is a top drawer image and will make the top 10 or I''ll eat my hat!', '2006-09-02 20:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2789930, 386435, 18073, '<td valign="top">The pose here makes the image!  I also really like the colour, very evocative and moody.  Your composition is also very nice, I expect to see this in the top ten, good luck.</td>', 'The pose here makes the image!  I also really like the colour, very evocative and moody.  Your composition is also very nice, I expect to see this in the top ten, good luck.', '2006-09-02 20:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
