(2791267, 387248, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is a better-than-good entry.<br/>That said, I find it lacking in depth of colour.<br/>It comes across as being flat in that respect.<br/>But I do like the composition, and the crop also works for me.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'This is a better-than-good entry.That said, I find it lacking in depth of colour.It comes across as being flat in that respect.But I do like the composition, and the crop also works for me.Good luck!', '2006-09-03 09:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791274, 385135, 39598, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot.<br/>The clouds above give the effect of being blown around by the helicopter''s "wash", as if they are a very direct, and very involved piece of the whole.<br/>An illusion of course, but a good one.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'This is a really nice shot.The clouds above give the effect of being blown around by the helicopter''s "wash", as if they are a very direct, and very involved piece of the whole.An illusion of course, but a good one.Good luck!', '2006-09-03 09:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791282, 387640, 39598, '<td valign="top">Something about the power lines spoils this shot.<br/>The leaves give an almost anime look and feel to the whole, but the effect is spoilt (for me) by the lines.<br/>Also, without the lines, and rotated 90 deg clockwise, this could be a really neat art shot.</td>', 'Something about the power lines spoils this shot.The leaves give an almost anime look and feel to the whole, but the effect is spoilt (for me) by the lines.Also, without the lines, and rotated 90 deg clockwise, this could be a really neat art shot.', '2006-09-03 09:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2791286, 387458, 39598, '<td valign="top">Very good composition!<br/>It''s lacking in depth of colour, for my liking, but otherwise is well put together.<br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Very good composition!It''s lacking in depth of colour, for my liking, but otherwise is well put together.Good luck!', '2006-09-03 09:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
