(2791303, 387767, 39598, '<td valign="top">The colour gradation is smooth throughout, which shows that this photo has not been over-processed (a common digital post-processing fault)<br/>The tight crop doesn''t sit well with me though, and the spread and variation of colour prevents this image from communicating anything concrete to me.<br/>A bit later with a full red sky, or a bit earlier with a full blue sky may have carried over a comprehensive message.</td>', 'The colour gradation is smooth throughout, which shows that this photo has not been over-processed (a common digital post-processing fault)The tight crop doesn''t sit well with me though, and the spread and variation of colour prevents this image from communicating anything concrete to me.A bit later with a full red sky, or a bit earlier with a full blue sky may have carried over a comprehensive message.', '2006-09-03 09:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
