(2792826, 387851, 18073, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate what you were trying to capture here, but for me you have not quite managed it.  The silhouette is not simple enough in shape to determine the pose.  I found I had to actually try and work out what is going on and this doesn''t make for a great silhouette.<br/> <br/>When you see the winners you can be certain that they will all be clear and well defined sihouettes.  This was a nice idea but you need to work on the pose to make it more ''clean''.</td>', 'I can appreciate what you were trying to capture here, but for me you have not quite managed it.  The silhouette is not simple enough in shape to determine the pose.  I found I had to actually try and work out what is going on and this doesn''t make for a great silhouette. When you see the winners you can be certain that they will all be clear and well defined sihouettes.  This was a nice idea but you need to work on the pose to make it more ''clean''.', '2006-09-03 19:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2792837, 386736, 18073, '<td valign="top">I really like this image.  Because of your unusual composition with the wall down the left of the image, it almost feels like your peeking into the room and catching a very touching moment between a little boy and his dog.<br/> <br/>I think the thing I love most is the rim lighting around the face and chest of the lad.  Lovely image, well done!</td>', 'I really like this image.  Because of your unusual composition with the wall down the left of the image, it almost feels like your peeking into the room and catching a very touching moment between a little boy and his dog. I think the thing I love most is the rim lighting around the face and chest of the lad.  Lovely image, well done!', '2006-09-03 19:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2792845, 387018, 18073, '<td valign="top">Interesting image.  The silhouettes are nice and give a menacing feel to the image, which I am sure is what you wanted to achieve.  The background is also interesting and adds to the mood nicely.  Good job!</td>', 'Interesting image.  The silhouettes are nice and give a menacing feel to the image, which I am sure is what you wanted to achieve.  The background is also interesting and adds to the mood nicely.  Good job!', '2006-09-03 19:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
