(2794065, 387417, 61352, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is a silhouette.  That aside -- image is front-focused, the blades of grass look sharp but the bovines are soft and blurred.  Bit of noise in the sky as well.</td>', 'Not sure how this is a silhouette.  That aside -- image is front-focused, the blades of grass look sharp but the bovines are soft and blurred.  Bit of noise in the sky as well.', '2006-09-04 01:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
