(2794097, 387472, 61352, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is a silhouette.  That aside, the subject of the image is unclear -- the focus appears to be on the vertical scaffolding, rather than on the concrete block / shadow?</td>', 'Not sure how this is a silhouette.  That aside, the subject of the image is unclear -- the focus appears to be on the vertical scaffolding, rather than on the concrete block / shadow?', '2006-09-04 01:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
