(2794122, 385457, 64700, '<td valign="top">Very contrived.</td>', 'Very contrived.', '2006-09-04 01:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794126, 387143, 64733, '<td valign="top">wish for more detail in the subject.</td>', 'wish for more detail in the subject.', '2006-09-04 01:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794131, 386736, 65067, '<td valign="top">I like how this shot is not a standard 2D silhouette like most of the other entries. The subjects stand out nicely against all the rectangular objects surrounding them.</td>', 'I like how this shot is not a standard 2D silhouette like most of the other entries. The subjects stand out nicely against all the rectangular objects surrounding them.', '2006-09-04 01:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794147, 385837, 65067, '<td valign="top">I like how the shadows of the parts of the hand are shown but wish that the water droplets were more visible.</td>', 'I like how the shadows of the parts of the hand are shown but wish that the water droplets were more visible.', '2006-09-04 01:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794148, 384757, 61352, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is a silhouette, or what the subject of the image is.  Focus appears sharpest on the lettering, but I don''t really understand what you''re trying to present to the viewer.</td>', 'Not sure how this is a silhouette, or what the subject of the image is.  Focus appears sharpest on the lettering, but I don''t really understand what you''re trying to present to the viewer.', '2006-09-04 01:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794153, 386736, 64700, '<td valign="top">The thing I like about this, is the stark contrast between the silhouetted and the background. Many photos in this particular competition have fuzzy edges that take away from the strong emotion silhouettes are supposed to evoke. Likewise, this photo seems less arbitrary and contrived than most in this competition. (I really don''t care what a statue of a man with a banjo looks like juxtapositioned against a sunset)</td>', 'The thing I like about this, is the stark contrast between the silhouetted and the background. Many photos in this particular competition have fuzzy edges that take away from the strong emotion silhouettes are supposed to evoke. Likewise, this photo seems less arbitrary and contrived than most in this competition. (I really don''t care what a statue of a man with a banjo looks like juxtapositioned against a sunset)', '2006-09-04 01:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794161, 386684, 64700, '<td valign="top">That flash looks like an adobe photoshop "lense flare"...</td>', 'That flash looks like an adobe photoshop "lense flare"...', '2006-09-04 01:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794181, 387712, 65067, '<td valign="top">This picture seems too busy and seems to lack a focal point. My eyes are more drawn to the edges because of the unbalance. It''s like a competition between a huge sky and a party of people with a boat.</td>', 'This picture seems too busy and seems to lack a focal point. My eyes are more drawn to the edges because of the unbalance. It''s like a competition between a huge sky and a party of people with a boat.', '2006-09-04 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794186, 387110, 65067, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and wonderful choice of subject.</td>', 'Lovely composition and wonderful choice of subject.', '2006-09-04 01:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794206, 386785, 65067, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of the subjects structure, the background, however, despite the nice blends of color, makes me feel cross-eyed.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of the subjects structure, the background, however, despite the nice blends of color, makes me feel cross-eyed.', '2006-09-04 01:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794225, 387831, 65067, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this picture from its composition to its colors. I like how you were able to get that wave breaking as something to run through the whole picture.</td>', 'Absolutely love this picture from its composition to its colors. I like how you were able to get that wave breaking as something to run through the whole picture.', '2006-09-04 01:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794241, 387640, 65067, '<td valign="top">I like how sharp all the edges are. It makes the leaves'' shape more interesting.</td>', 'I like how sharp all the edges are. It makes the leaves'' shape more interesting.', '2006-09-04 02:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794250, 386760, 65067, '<td valign="top">All I see is blue, a little purple, bright pink, and black. Why is there a random black corner?</td>', 'All I see is blue, a little purple, bright pink, and black. Why is there a random black corner?', '2006-09-04 02:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2794256, 384959, 65067, '<td valign="top">Interesting view. Your title fits it very well.</td>', 'Interesting view. Your title fits it very well.', '2006-09-04 02:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
