(2795944, 384765, 49816, '<td valign="top">I find this a powerful photo in terms of content and tension and was deeply moved by it. It works well as a silhouette with just enough mystery.  I especially like that little sliver of light between the two windows - indicating to me that there is some element of hope as they possibly contemplate the journey ahead of them.  Without it I think they would have appeared trapped somehow.  The barren fields remind me of an Anselm Kiefer painting (a famous german painter - if you are not familiar with him).  The only element that distracted me was the little white dots on the lower right corner.  A wonderful phot and I would love to have a print of it.</td>', 'I find this a powerful photo in terms of content and tension and was deeply moved by it. It works well as a silhouette with just enough mystery.  I especially like that little sliver of light between the two windows - indicating to me that there is some element of hope as they possibly contemplate the journey ahead of them.  Without it I think they would have appeared trapped somehow.  The barren fields remind me of an Anselm Kiefer painting (a famous german painter - if you are not familiar with him).  The only element that distracted me was the little white dots on the lower right corner.  A wonderful phot and I would love to have a print of it.', '2006-09-04 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
