(2796261, 385868, 49816, '<td valign="top">John, I would like to see a print of it - comptuer displays can be tricky. It appears too red/orange and borders on more of a fantasy scene (which is not necessarily a bad thing - I sort of like the surrealness of it). I''m not sure either about the large overhanging tree.  It does not seem to fit in with the rest of the photograph.  I do like the silhouette of the tree stumps scattered over the water.  They look like little figures.  I also like the trees on the horizon. Not sure though about the tree in the foreground. It blocks my view.</td>', 'John, I would like to see a print of it - comptuer displays can be tricky. It appears too red/orange and borders on more of a fantasy scene (which is not necessarily a bad thing - I sort of like the surrealness of it). I''m not sure either about the large overhanging tree.  It does not seem to fit in with the rest of the photograph.  I do like the silhouette of the tree stumps scattered over the water.  They look like little figures.  I also like the trees on the horizon. Not sure though about the tree in the foreground. It blocks my view.', '2006-09-04 12:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
