(2797001, 384765, 57886, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting picture.... Would absolutely love it if the outlines of the kids were more obvious... as it is it gets a 7 from me because I love the pp and surroundings ... good luck :o)</td>', 'This is a very interesting picture.... Would absolutely love it if the outlines of the kids were more obvious... as it is it gets a 7 from me because I love the pp and surroundings ... good luck :o)', '2006-09-04 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
