(2800422, 385168, 64773, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! But, the hand positions seem confusing against the tight lines of the silhouette, and either some light coming through the dress would be nice, or better yet, no material on the body would have been magic.</td>', 'Gorgeous! But, the hand positions seem confusing against the tight lines of the silhouette, and either some light coming through the dress would be nice, or better yet, no material on the body would have been magic.', '2006-09-05 12:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
