(2801287, 386171, 63703, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea, and the execution. The one thing that spoils the picture is the model''s pose - it looks very contrived. The model seems more intent on separating the tags from his body than on conveying the despair of burying a friend. That kills what could have been a 10.</td>', 'I really like the idea, and the execution. The one thing that spoils the picture is the model''s pose - it looks very contrived. The model seems more intent on separating the tags from his body than on conveying the despair of burying a friend. That kills what could have been a 10.', '2006-09-05 17:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
