(2803789, 387994, 57936, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite places and favorite places to shoot! I was just there over the summer, but didn''t get to take any nighttime shots. This is wonderful!!! I didn''t see this one during voting or it would have gotten another 10! Congrats on your high finish!</td>', 'One of my favorite places and favorite places to shoot! I was just there over the summer, but didn''t get to take any nighttime shots. This is wonderful!!! I didn''t see this one during voting or it would have gotten another 10! Congrats on your high finish!', '2006-09-06 05:46:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2803793, 387657, 22301, '<td valign="top">this shot is awesome, I love how you did this! great job and should have been much higher. you should look at this <a href="//dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a>. It will show you what to do to get your photos ready for challenges. Your photo is 80 kb and the max allowable is 150 kb. That means all those small artifacts that someone mentioned would have been much smoother and less noticeable. amazing shot. well done.</td>', 'this shot is awesome, I love how you did this! great job and should have been much higher. you should look at this tutorial. It will show you what to do to get your photos ready for challenges. Your photo is 80 kb and the max allowable is 150 kb. That means all those small artifacts that someone mentioned would have been much smoother and less noticeable. amazing shot. well done.', '2006-09-06 05:49:48.000000', NULL, 0),
