(2805168, 387853, 39349, '<td valign="top">Well Cindi, this should have placed MUCH higher. I was one of your three 10''s in this challenge. I thought you nailed it perfectly. I guess both our shots suffered the wrath of the masses not seeing them as silhouettes. Great work girl!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Well Cindi, this should have placed MUCH higher. I was one of your three 10''s in this challenge. I thought you nailed it perfectly. I guess both our shots suffered the wrath of the masses not seeing them as silhouettes. Great work girl! ', '2006-09-06 12:45:40.000000', NULL, 0),
