(2806592, 387247, 60173, '<td valign="top">Popcorn clouds! I''m not sure what would have been a better subject than the building. With clouds like those you definately want those to be a large part of the photo, but the building doesn''t have a whole lot of detail. As for the comment below about the "green not working".. apparently that person hasn''t seen those clouds in person. That''s probably darn near the actual sky color, heh. I used to live in Indiana and when the windows got dark most people were praying the sky wouldn''t turn green. I on the other hand was running for my camera and heading outside. Where there''s green skies... there''sah big stormah comin!  =)</td>', 'Popcorn clouds! I''m not sure what would have been a better subject than the building. With clouds like those you definately want those to be a large part of the photo, but the building doesn''t have a whole lot of detail. As for the comment below about the "green not working".. apparently that person hasn''t seen those clouds in person. That''s probably darn near the actual sky color, heh. I used to live in Indiana and when the windows got dark most people were praying the sky wouldn''t turn green. I on the other hand was running for my camera and heading outside. Where there''s green skies... there''sah big stormah comin!  =)', '2006-09-06 18:16:45.000000', NULL, 0),
