(2806784, 387998, 51001, '<td valign="top">Thanks for everyone who voted for me  :-)<br/> <br/>To answer a few of the questions from the challenge:<br/> <br/> - The main silhouette is intended to be the kayaker<br/> - The sun is 100% real; 300mm of zoom makes it look so big<br/> - I probably should have rotated the waterline a bit more<br/> - I''m shooting with an EOS 10D, and noise can definitely<br/>    be a problem at times.  I suppose I could have tried the<br/>    shot at ISO 100.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for everyone who voted for me  :-) To answer a few of the questions from the challenge:  - The main silhouette is intended to be the kayaker - The sun is 100% real; 300mm of zoom makes it look so big - I probably should have rotated the waterline a bit more - I''m shooting with an EOS 10D, and noise can definitely    be a problem at times.  I suppose I could have tried the    shot at ISO 100.', '2006-09-06 19:14:28.000000', NULL, 0),
