(2807178, 387247, 3569, '<td valign="top">This is only the second time in my life I headed for the basement from a storm.  We lost power for two days and a large tree fell into our driveway with the strong wind.  But the mammatus clouds are so wonderful after the storm.  Thanks for the comments.  Van<br/> <br/>P.S. I was trying for another shot like the one I entered before, but the clouds were to the east this time and sunset was an hour later. <br/> <br/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=96794" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/3569/thumb/96794.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/3569/thumb/96794.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/3569/thumb/96794.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-06 19:58:25.</i></td>', 'This is only the second time in my life I headed for the basement from a storm.  We lost power for two days and a large tree fell into our driveway with the strong wind.  But the mammatus clouds are so wonderful after the storm.  Thanks for the comments.  Van P.S. I was trying for another shot like the one I entered before, but the clouds were to the east this time and sunset was an hour later.   ', '2006-09-06 20:52:27.000000', '2006-09-06 20:58:25.000000', 0),
