(2807713, 386130, 55199, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, and the title. :)  I think it would have been enhanced quite a bit if you had cropped off the yellow backlighting on the right and the right half of her head.  This would draw our attention much more to her eyes and secondly to her hands/camera. As far as darkening... mostly the ear and earing are a bit distracting; some adjustments might help those features to not be as outstanding.  Also the crop would help here too, imo, because at the moment her earing is at one of those rule of thirds intersections and cropping the right would move it well away from there.</td>', 'I like this photo, and the title. :)  I think it would have been enhanced quite a bit if you had cropped off the yellow backlighting on the right and the right half of her head.  This would draw our attention much more to her eyes and secondly to her hands/camera. As far as darkening... mostly the ear and earing are a bit distracting; some adjustments might help those features to not be as outstanding.  Also the crop would help here too, imo, because at the moment her earing is at one of those rule of thirds intersections and cropping the right would move it well away from there.', '2006-09-06 22:35:40.000000', NULL, 0),
