(2808987, 384681, 60165, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bucket:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this was simply the best shot in the challenge... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey, Bucket, thank you so much for your support. I like it myself, but it seems many voted it down for not being a "real" silhouette to them ...<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by bucket: I think this was simply the best shot in the challenge...   Hey, Bucket, thank you so much for your support. I like it myself, but it seems many voted it down for not being a "real" silhouette to them ... ', '2006-09-07 05:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
