(2821370, 386729, 64571, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that took the time to vote and to comment.  I appreciate all of the nice compliments and welcome any constructive advice that you would be willing to express!</td>', 'Thanks to all that took the time to vote and to comment.  I appreciate all of the nice compliments and welcome any constructive advice that you would be willing to express!', '2006-09-10 21:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
