(2842641, 386228, 7810, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=397014" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7810/thumb/397014.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7810/thumb/397014.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/7810/thumb/397014.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Great shot ...great placing<br/> <br/>Had to share, this pick is from film about 17 years ago. the angel in my shot just started University this year. They grow up real fast<br/> <br/>Thanks for the memory<br/> <br/>Coley<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-17 14:02:22.</i></td>', '  Great shot ...great placing Had to share, this pick is from film about 17 years ago. the angel in my shot just started University this year. They grow up real fast Thanks for the memory Coley', '2006-09-17 15:01:29.000000', '2006-09-17 15:02:22.000000', 0),
