(2855547, 386228, 59564, '<td valign="top">Coley:  That''s awesome!  I''m hoping one day I can show this shot to Zach (toss-ee in the picture) and bring back memories.  <br/> <br/>Thank you for the sharing!!</td>', 'Coley:  That''s awesome!  I''m hoping one day I can show this shot to Zach (toss-ee in the picture) and bring back memories.   Thank you for the sharing!!', '2006-09-22 00:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2863481, 387247, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wow, Van - that must have been some storm! I love your sky shots, you have a way with the sky and especially with these mammatus clouds. The duo tone you chose for this really enhances the mood for the picture - very melodramatic. I can''t wait to see your house someday - Jack and I need to get to Pueblo to visit you and Kristyn! Big old houses fascinate me - especially the ones that look haunted!<br/> <br/>A few weeks ago when Jack and I were out walking we finally saw some of these mammatus clouds in the valley - they weren''t as dramatic as the ones you get in Pueblo but it really surprised us to see them. We''ve never, ever seen them here before. It was a time when we were having some severe storms.</td>', 'Wow, Van - that must have been some storm! I love your sky shots, you have a way with the sky and especially with these mammatus clouds. The duo tone you chose for this really enhances the mood for the picture - very melodramatic. I can''t wait to see your house someday - Jack and I need to get to Pueblo to visit you and Kristyn! Big old houses fascinate me - especially the ones that look haunted! A few weeks ago when Jack and I were out walking we finally saw some of these mammatus clouds in the valley - they weren''t as dramatic as the ones you get in Pueblo but it really surprised us to see them. We''ve never, ever seen them here before. It was a time when we were having some severe storms.', '2006-09-25 14:48:52.000000', NULL, 0),
