(2874885, 384681, 60165, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ragga2000:</b></div><hr/><i> This image is so good. It is sad how sometimes people vote pictures down because of a "misunderstanding"... IMHO it was one of the best silhouettes in the challenge... and the title is PERFECT for the image, absolutely what you think when you look at the picture :o) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think the idea here is to pleeeez the masses.<br/> <br/>Thank you for the nice comment and understanding, I am sure you miss it yourself, although you must be happy back home with your ever expanding family! Did you see the latest newsletter?<br/> <br/>Did you see that I only discovered the float plane when processing the pictures? This shot was the only on of the shots with other planes in it ...</td>', 'Originally posted by Ragga2000: This image is so good. It is sad how sometimes people vote pictures down because of a "misunderstanding"... IMHO it was one of the best silhouettes in the challenge... and the title is PERFECT for the image, absolutely what you think when you look at the picture :o)   I think the idea here is to pleeeez the masses. Thank you for the nice comment and understanding, I am sure you miss it yourself, although you must be happy back home with your ever expanding family! Did you see the latest newsletter? Did you see that I only discovered the float plane when processing the pictures? This shot was the only on of the shots with other planes in it ...', '2006-09-29 05:07:09.000000', NULL, 0),
