(4101926, 385152, 63269, '<td valign="top">So interesting... the title is a contradition, as is the photo itself.  The silhouettes weave in and out of focus. Some are sharp, others are fuzzy and soft, so that the same time, I can almost <i>feel</i> a prickly scratch of thorns, and a sort of fuzzy tickling sensation. Very unique and evocative image!</td>', 'So interesting... the title is a contradition, as is the photo itself.  The silhouettes weave in and out of focus. Some are sharp, others are fuzzy and soft, so that the same time, I can almost feel a prickly scratch of thorns, and a sort of fuzzy tickling sensation. Very unique and evocative image!', '2007-09-19 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4292263, 386263, 39218, '<td valign="top">I find it interesting that so many people are so thrown off by the writing... to me it only added an element to the scene.  Perhaps because I have a curious tendency, my thought would be what was the entire word... if it had been an entirely distinguishable word, THAT might have thrown me off.  I would not change a thing about this submission... except perhaps maybe that it had done better.  <br/> <br/>I love the happenstance story behind the submission.  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'I find it interesting that so many people are so thrown off by the writing... to me it only added an element to the scene.  Perhaps because I have a curious tendency, my thought would be what was the entire word... if it had been an entirely distinguishable word, THAT might have thrown me off.  I would not change a thing about this submission... except perhaps maybe that it had done better.   I love the happenstance story behind the submission.  Thanks for sharing!', '2007-12-05 13:11:04.000000', NULL, 0),
